/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Console build inputs. `frontend/dist` is deliberately NOT ignored: the `serve`
# feature embeds it with rust_embed, and neither `cargo install` nor a CI build
# can run npm. It is committed on purpose.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.tsbuild/
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local scratch
*.dlq.ndjson
*-gate-stats.json
.env
# The playground's engine, copied beside it to serve it (js/README.md).
/js/covenant.wasm
# The stream-processor integrations build in their own directories.
/integrations/**/target
/integrations/redpanda-transform/*.wasm
# `maturin develop` builds the extension into the package directory.
/python/covenant_data/*.so
/python/covenant_data/*.pyd
